	(text "GNSS - u-blox NEO-M9N, 25 Hz max, four constellations\nUART (UBX-NAV-PVT) to the nRF52840; TIMEPULSE aligns every pod's\nsamples to GNSS time, EXTINT and RESET_N are under MCU control.\nVDD_USB tied to GND: the module's USB is not used. D_SEL open.\nPassive 25 mm patch: the NEO-M9N has its own SAW + LNA.\nZ1-Z3: pi network, fitted as a 0R link, for tuning in the case."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 17.78 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "1e94532a-dcd4-571b-85d5-2adcc495d55a")
	)
	(text "IMU - ISM330DHCX on its own SPI bus, so 1-6.7 kHz IMU reads\nnever wait for a microSD write. INT1/INT2 to the MCU."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 132.08 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "9ecf8e2d-237f-5be5-b7af-54a3801f11de")
	)
	(text "MCU + BLE - Raytac MDBT50Q-1MV2 (nRF52840).\nBLE for live status/download, USB for bulk log download.\nP0.18 = nRESET, P1.00 = SWO (TC2030 Tag-Connect, no header).\nBattery: VBAT/2 on AIN0 (P0.02)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 17.78 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "5e128dcf-63a8-5b76-93af-65fae70a232c")
	)
	(text "microSD in SPI mode; DAT1/DAT2 pulled up, card detect\nswitch to GND, read on P0.12 with the internal pull-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 294.64 101.6 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "4159cb82-176f-5ba6-91b3-00b66b8584f3")
	)
	(text "POWER - USB-C (5.1k Rd) -> MCP73831, 500 mA -> 1S Li-Po.\nQ1 + D1: load sharing, the system runs from USB when present.\nAP2112K-3.3 feeds everything; GNSS V_BCKP stays on 3V3 so\nSystem OFF keeps the ephemeris for a hot start."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 246.38 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "d4606ea6-9c4f-579f-b579-c3bdc15a8ef4")
	)
